  "scene": {
    "id": "distribute",
    "language": "[0]Okay, so I'm gonna overlap my teammate to the right side. My teammate with the ball is in front of me, and he's blocked by an opponent. So what I should do is, uh, overlap on the right side,[1] and then h- teammate will have a l- angle of pass between me and the, and, and the ball, so he can pass it to me. And then when I get the ball, I'll decide if I want to shoot[2] for the goal or, um, or pass it back to my teammate, depending on how close the opponent is to me. So I'm gonna go over here.[3] I'm gonna tell him to pass.[4] [5][6]Okay,[7] so now that I have the ball, I can see the opponent is very close to me, but the l- the shot towards the goal is pretty open now. Um, so in this case, I'll, I'll run towards the goal and then make the shot.[8]",
